{"id":"73482b453f46909f","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-satisfaction.md","title":"多排序集合模型的递归满足关系","display":"df-satisfaction — 多排序集合模型的递归满足关系","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs - Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-satisfaction","aliases":["16-df-satisfaction"],"display":"df-satisfaction — 多排序集合模型的递归满足关系","depends_on":["[[16-df-formula]]"],"source":"§0.2 pp. 11–13 (PDF 31–33); §4.1 pp. 222–224 (PDF 242–244); local recursive set semantics","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs - Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-satisfaction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-satisfaction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-satisfaction — 多排序集合模型的递归满足关系"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"24a3d0c12f4602b7\" href=\"?note=24a3d0c12f4602b7\" title=\"16-df-formula\">16-df-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§0.2 pp. 11–13 (PDF 31–33); §4.1 pp. 222–224 (PDF 242–244); local recursive set semantics"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\langle S,F,P,a_F,a_P\\rangle\">\\(\\Sigma=\\langle S,F,P,a_F,a_P\\rangle\\)</span> 及所有项/公式树、变量池 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_s\">\\(V_s\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"24a3d0c12f4602b7\" href=\"?note=24a3d0c12f4602b7\" title=\"16-df-formula\">16-df-formula</a>。</li>\n<li>模型数据是三分量记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=\\langle(M_s)_{s\\in S},(M^F_f)_{f\\in F},(M^P_p)_{p\\in P}\\rangle\">\\(M=\\langle(M_s)_{s\\in S},(M^F_f)_{f\\in F},(M^P_p)_{p\\in P}\\rangle\\)</span>。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_s\">\\(M_s\\)</span> 是小集合；对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in F\">\\(f\\in F\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M^F_f:\\prod_{j=1}^{|a_F^{\\mathrm{in}}(f)|}M_{a_F^{\\mathrm{in}}(f)_j}\\to M_{a_F^{\\mathrm{out}}(f)}\">\\(M^F_f:\\prod_{j=1}^{|a_F^{\\mathrm{in}}(f)|}M_{a_F^{\\mathrm{in}}(f)_j}\\to M_{a_F^{\\mathrm{out}}(f)}\\)</span>；对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in P\">\\(p\\in P\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M^P_p\\subseteq\\prod_{j=1}^{|a_P(p)|}M_{a_P(p)_j}\">\\(M^P_p\\subseteq\\prod_{j=1}^{|a_P(p)|}M_{a_P(p)_j}\\)</span>。元数投影采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"24a3d0c12f4602b7\" href=\"?note=24a3d0c12f4602b7\" title=\"16-df-formula\">16-df-formula</a>；三类解释按记录分量区分，不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,F,P\">\\(S,F,P\\)</span> 互不相交，也不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_s\">\\(M_s\\)</span> 非空。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 是有限部分函数，定义域包含当前项/公式的 FV，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V_s\\cap\\operatorname{dom}\\beta\">\\(x\\in V_s\\cap\\operatorname{dom}\\beta\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta(x)\\in M_s\">\\(\\beta(x)\\in M_s\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 为无重复变量的有限列表。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A=M\">\\(\\mathfrak A=M\\)</span> 是旧记号的同一模型数据。</li>\n<li>下文的递归只在良构有限树上进行；二元标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf a,\\mathsf o,\\mathsf i\">\\(\\mathsf a,\\mathsf o,\\mathsf i\\)</span> 与量词标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf u,\\mathsf x\">\\(\\mathsf u,\\mathsf x\\)</span> 的含义由正式递归式给出。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\beta[x\\mapsto a]&amp;\\coloneqq\n(\\beta\\restriction(\\operatorname{dom}\\beta\\setminus\\{x\\}))\\cup\\{\\langle x,a\\rangle\\},\\\\\n⟦\\mathsf v(x)⟧_M^\\beta&amp;\\coloneqq\\beta(x),\\\\\n⟦\\mathsf f(f,\\vec t)⟧_M^\\beta&amp;\\coloneqq\nM^F_f\\bigl((⟦ t_j⟧_M^\\beta)_{j=1}^{|\\vec t|}\\bigr),\\\\\nM,\\beta\\models\\mathsf e(s,t,u)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n⟦ t⟧_M^\\beta=⟦ u⟧_M^\\beta,\\\\\nM,\\beta\\models\\mathsf p(p,\\vec t)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(⟦ t_j⟧_M^\\beta)_{j=1}^{|\\vec t|}\\in M^P_p,\\\\\nM,\\beta\\models\\mathsf t&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\top,&amp;\nM,\\beta\\models\\mathsf b&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\bot,\\\\\nM,\\beta\\models\\mathsf a(\\varphi,\\psi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(M,\\beta\\models\\varphi)\\land(M,\\beta\\models\\psi),\\\\\nM,\\beta\\models\\mathsf o(\\varphi,\\psi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(M,\\beta\\models\\varphi)\\lor(M,\\beta\\models\\psi),\\\\\nM,\\beta\\models\\mathsf i(\\varphi,\\psi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n((M,\\beta\\models\\varphi)\\Longrightarrow(M,\\beta\\models\\psi)),\\\\\nM,\\beta\\models\\mathsf u(x,\\varphi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall a\\in M_s)\\ M,\\beta[x\\mapsto a]\\models\\varphi\\qquad(x\\in V_s),\\\\\nM,\\beta\\models\\mathsf x(x,\\varphi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists a\\in M_s)\\ M,\\beta[x\\mapsto a]\\models\\varphi\\qquad(x\\in V_s),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Asn}_M(\\Gamma)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\beta\\in(\\bigcup_{s\\in S}M_s)^{\\operatorname{set}(\\Gamma)}\\mid\n(\\forall s\\in S)(\\forall x\\in V_s\\cap\\operatorname{dom}\\beta)\\ \\beta(x)\\in M_s\\},\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow M,\\beta\\models\\varphi.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\beta[x\\mapsto a]&amp;\\coloneqq\n(\\beta\\restriction(\\operatorname{dom}\\beta\\setminus\\{x\\}))\\cup\\{\\langle x,a\\rangle\\},\\\\\n⟦\\mathsf v(x)⟧_M^\\beta&amp;\\coloneqq\\beta(x),\\\\\n⟦\\mathsf f(f,\\vec t)⟧_M^\\beta&amp;\\coloneqq\nM^F_f\\bigl((⟦ t_j⟧_M^\\beta)_{j=1}^{|\\vec t|}\\bigr),\\\\\nM,\\beta\\models\\mathsf e(s,t,u)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n⟦ t⟧_M^\\beta=⟦ u⟧_M^\\beta,\\\\\nM,\\beta\\models\\mathsf p(p,\\vec t)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(⟦ t_j⟧_M^\\beta)_{j=1}^{|\\vec t|}\\in M^P_p,\\\\\nM,\\beta\\models\\mathsf t&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\top,&amp;\nM,\\beta\\models\\mathsf b&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\bot,\\\\\nM,\\beta\\models\\mathsf a(\\varphi,\\psi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(M,\\beta\\models\\varphi)\\land(M,\\beta\\models\\psi),\\\\\nM,\\beta\\models\\mathsf o(\\varphi,\\psi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(M,\\beta\\models\\varphi)\\lor(M,\\beta\\models\\psi),\\\\\nM,\\beta\\models\\mathsf i(\\varphi,\\psi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n((M,\\beta\\models\\varphi)\\Longrightarrow(M,\\beta\\models\\psi)),\\\\\nM,\\beta\\models\\mathsf u(x,\\varphi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall a\\in M_s)\\ M,\\beta[x\\mapsto a]\\models\\varphi\\qquad(x\\in V_s),\\\\\nM,\\beta\\models\\mathsf x(x,\\varphi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists a\\in M_s)\\ M,\\beta[x\\mapsto a]\\models\\varphi\\qquad(x\\in V_s),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Asn}_M(\\Gamma)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\beta\\in(\\bigcup_{s\\in S}M_s)^{\\operatorname{set}(\\Gamma)}\\mid\n(\\forall s\\in S)(\\forall x\\in V_s\\cap\\operatorname{dom}\\beta)\\ \\beta(x)\\in M_s\\},\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow M,\\beta\\models\\varphi.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是 §0.2 的集合谓词模型在 §4.1 一阶公式片段上的显式递归解释（§0.2, pp. 11–13 / PDF 31–33；§4.1, pp. 222–224 / PDF 242–244）。本页不再把“写出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span>”当成定义。</p>\n<p>结构递归给出项值与满足关系的存在唯一性。对树归纳可证：满足性只依赖 FV 上的赋值，故有限部分赋值足够；量词递归把被绑定变量加入或覆盖，避免假定所有变量池都有全局赋值。空排序允许存在量词为假、全称量词为真；空语境赋值恰有空函数一个。这里的集合模型是经典二值语义，并不据此断言任意纤维化也有二值解释。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"24a3d0c12f4602b7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"24a3d0c12f4602b7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\langle S,F,P,a_F,a_P\\rangle$ 及所有项/公式树、变量池 $V_s$ 见 [[16-df-formula]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"24a3d0c12f4602b7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"模型数据是三分量记录 $M=\\langle(M_s)_{s\\in S},(M^F_f)_{f\\in F},(M^P_p)_{p\\in P}\\rangle$。每个 $M_s$ 是小集合；对每个 $f\\in F$，$M^F_f:\\prod_{j=1}^{|a_F^{\\mathrm{in}}(f)|}M_{a_F^{\\mathrm{in}}(f)_j}\\to M_{a_F^{\\mathrm{out}}(f)}$；对每个 $p\\in P$，$M^P_p\\subseteq\\prod_{j=1}^{|a_P(p)|}M_{a_P(p)_j}$。元数投影采用 [[16-df-formula]]；三类解释按记录分量区分，不要求 $S,F,P$ 互不相交，也不要求 $M_s$ 非空。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\langle S,F,P,a_F,a_P\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"V_s","display":false},{"tex":"M=\\langle(M_s)_{s\\in S},(M^F_f)_{f\\in F},(M^P_p)_{p\\in P}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"M_s","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in F","display":false},{"tex":"M^F_f:\\prod_{j=1}^{|a_F^{\\mathrm{in}}(f)|}M_{a_F^{\\mathrm{in}}(f)_j}\\to M_{a_F^{\\mathrm{out}}(f)}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"M^P_p\\subseteq\\prod_{j=1}^{|a_P(p)|}M_{a_P(p)_j}","display":false},{"tex":"S,F,P","display":false},{"tex":"M_s","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V_s\\cap\\operatorname{dom}\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta(x)\\in M_s","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A=M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf a,\\mathsf o,\\mathsf i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf u,\\mathsf x","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\beta[x\\mapsto a]&\\coloneqq\n(\\beta\\restriction(\\operatorname{dom}\\beta\\setminus\\{x\\}))\\cup\\{\\langle x,a\\rangle\\},\\\\\n⟦\\mathsf v(x)⟧_M^\\beta&\\coloneqq\\beta(x),\\\\\n⟦\\mathsf f(f,\\vec t)⟧_M^\\beta&\\coloneqq\nM^F_f\\bigl((⟦ t_j⟧_M^\\beta)_{j=1}^{|\\vec t|}\\bigr),\\\\\nM,\\beta\\models\\mathsf e(s,t,u)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n⟦ t⟧_M^\\beta=⟦ u⟧_M^\\beta,\\\\\nM,\\beta\\models\\mathsf p(p,\\vec t)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n(⟦ t_j⟧_M^\\beta)_{j=1}^{|\\vec t|}\\in M^P_p,\\\\\nM,\\beta\\models\\mathsf t&\\Longleftrightarrow\\top,&\nM,\\beta\\models\\mathsf b&\\Longleftrightarrow\\bot,\\\\\nM,\\beta\\models\\mathsf a(\\varphi,\\psi)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n(M,\\beta\\models\\varphi)\\land(M,\\beta\\models\\psi),\\\\\nM,\\beta\\models\\mathsf o(\\varphi,\\psi)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n(M,\\beta\\models\\varphi)\\lor(M,\\beta\\models\\psi),\\\\\nM,\\beta\\models\\mathsf i(\\varphi,\\psi)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n((M,\\beta\\models\\varphi)\\Longrightarrow(M,\\beta\\models\\psi)),\\\\\nM,\\beta\\models\\mathsf u(x,\\varphi)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall a\\in M_s)\\ M,\\beta[x\\mapsto a]\\models\\varphi\\qquad(x\\in V_s),\\\\\nM,\\beta\\models\\mathsf x(x,\\varphi)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists a\\in M_s)\\ M,\\beta[x\\mapsto a]\\models\\varphi\\qquad(x\\in V_s),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Asn}_M(\\Gamma)&\\coloneqq\\{\\beta\\in(\\bigcup_{s\\in S}M_s)^{\\operatorname{set}(\\Gamma)}\\mid\n(\\forall s\\in S)(\\forall x\\in V_s\\cap\\operatorname{dom}\\beta)\\ \\beta(x)\\in M_s\\},\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]&\\Longleftrightarrow M,\\beta\\models\\varphi.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\models","display":false}],"bytes":3606,"backlinks":[{"id":"3b0e1c2615f805e4","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma$、$\\operatorname{Fml}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)$ 见 [[16-df-formula]]；$M$ 为该多排序签名的集合模型，$\\operatorname{Asn}_M(\\Gamma)$ 及 $M,\\beta\\models\\varphi$ 采用 [[16-df-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-function]]、[[16-df-formula]]、[[16-df-provable]]、[[16-df-satisfaction]]、[[16-df-validity-fo]]、[[16-df-type-interpretation]]、[[16-df-general-quantifier]]、[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]、[[16-df-frobenius]]、[[16-df-regular-category]]、[[16-df-coherent-category]]、[[16-df-first-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-higher-order-fibration]]。"}],"outgoing":["24a3d0c12f4602b7"]}